ate resolver-renderer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pipeline while preserving staging, consumption tracking, builtin output [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compatibility, and Jinja safety.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Unify filtered completion across invocation surfaces[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reference-completion[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-ref-contract, python-ref-registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference-completion: drive TUI and LSP completion for both `@kind:` and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`#ref/kind` from the same filtered artifact inventory and invalidate it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on all relevant source/config changes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove the end-to-end contract and document it[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]integration-and-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after artifact-rendering, reference-completion[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration-and-docs: add cross-surface tests, migration/config [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation, and full combined-tree verification for artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference xprompts.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ho","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ho.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-ho.1"},"source_run_id":"run-8ae12dc7801ce73184c96bc459fd236e","started_at":"2026-08-08T17:40:58.196269+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"b078667cb3e67dae7762ca8823833c9891ea470e04bb7101d684fc8b8e969649","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ho.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"c68860115b2c514a5ab997e763b33b141a2ad67f2f8a0e8b42bb3f45bc128a59","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ho.land/meta.json","size_bytes":572},"prompt"